            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.26.13+ACT.26.14+ACT.26.15+ACT.26.16+ACT.26.17+ACT.26.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26.13-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ammo Waaqi, eeba isaatiini, ato anini ind'alatiini na yaame na fohate, aka anini isaa hojad'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafa inni Ilma isaa nati mullise, aka anini gosa d'ibiti Odu Dansa odeesu, anini gara nama tokole gorsa ind'anne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yokhaani Yerusalemu d'aqe worra na durati ergattu tahe argu ind'anne. Ammo, maro tokotu, lafa Arafti d'aqe, jennaani Damaskiti deebie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.9.26+ACT.9.27+ACT.9.28+ACT.9.29+ACT.9.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Huji 9.26-30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Eegi ganna sadi anini Yerusalemu d'aqe, aka odu Kefa iraa fuud'u, torbaani lama fulla isaa tae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini ergattu d'ibi tokole ingarre, Yakobo oboleesa Aabbo male.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonti anini t'aafu kunini waan d'ugaati, anini kiyyibuuti injiru, Waaqi na didinna!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
